1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,700
Your agents have a Kanban board

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:03,090
now.

3
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:05,180
And they move the tickets themselves.

4
00:00:05,543 --> 00:00:06,523
Ten lanes.

5
00:00:07,083 --> 00:00:09,443
Every ticket sits in exactly one.

6
00:00:09,799 --> 00:00:11,119
This one is blocked.

7
00:00:11,579 --> 00:00:13,119
The board says for how long.

8
00:00:13,579 --> 00:00:15,119
Halfway through,

9
00:00:16,159 --> 00:00:17,359
you remember something.

10
00:00:18,139 --> 00:00:19,239
So you say it.

11
00:00:22,419 --> 00:00:23,019
And

12
00:00:23,178 --> 00:00:25,578
It doesn't land in the scrollback.

13
00:00:26,318 --> 00:00:27,558
It becomes a ticket.

14
00:00:27,879 --> 00:00:30,259
Cued as T nine.

15
00:00:31,219 --> 00:00:31,959
Written into the journal.

16
00:00:32,007 --> 00:00:34,287
An agent finishes, and moves its

17
00:00:34,287 --> 00:00:35,387
own card to done.

18
00:00:35,612 --> 00:00:37,312
Hit a real decision,

19
00:00:37,972 --> 00:00:38,832
and it asks you here.

20
00:00:38,987 --> 00:00:40,307
Recommendation included. You answer on the board,

21
00:00:40,867 --> 00:00:41,607
and it carries on.

22
00:00:41,985 --> 00:00:43,345
Then the bill.

23
00:00:44,625 --> 00:00:46,165
Four and a half million tokens.

24
00:00:46,590 --> 00:00:48,930
The scout did the reconnaissance for

25
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:49,690
three cents.

26
00:00:50,077 --> 00:00:51,737
This board is Tyran,

27
00:00:52,617 --> 00:00:53,317
building Tyran.

28
00:00:53,676 --> 00:00:54,856
Click it yourself.

29
00:00:55,696 --> 00:00:56,276
Nothing to install.
